@format 1
@id queue.apply-runner-configuration
@title Apply runner configuration
@area 4. Queue and scheduling
@entry input
@summary Copy the current renderer, parallelism, pause-on-failure, and retry preferences into a station runner before starting it.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related processing.start

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias runner = Cadroue.ShellEngine.LRunner

[input] Station start requested <input>
- Read the active station's runner @ console.PConsoleStartHandle(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply current configuration <process>
- Set renderer program, parallel limit, failure pause, retry permission, and retry limit @ console.PConsoleRunnerApply(...)
> start

[start] Continue runner start <output>
- Start the configured runner @ runner.LRunnerStart(...)
= New worker execution uses the current preferences.
